# Normalise everything to LF in the repository.
#
# The working copy on Windows uses CRLF (core.autocrlf=true), but the repository — and
# therefore CI on ubuntu-latest — must be LF. The `themes-only` job in ci.yml runs shell
# scripts, and a CRLF script fails on Linux with `bad interpreter: /bin/sh^M`, which is a
# confusing way to learn about line endings.
#
# PNGs are listed as binary so Git never tries to normalise them.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.woff2 binary
*.woff binary
